  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;LOUISA HANKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Louisa Hankey is a member of the British peerage, born into a family of noble lineage, and known for her dedication to public service and her marriage to Matthew Darby-Griffith and František Zwyrtek."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MATTHEW DARBY-GRIFFITH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Matthew Darby-Griffith is a decorated British Army general, known for his dedication to his country and his marriage to Louisa Hankey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRANTIŠEK ZWYRTEK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"František Zwyrtek is a prominent Czech politician, known for his work in promoting European unity and social justice, and his marriage to Louisa Hankey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRITISH PEERAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The British peerage is a system of nobility in the United Kingdom, where titles and traditions hold sway, and Louisa Hankey is a member."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRITISH ARMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The British Army is a military branch where Matthew Darby-Griffith served as a general, known for its dedication to duty and discipline."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CZECH PARLIAMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Czech Parliament is a legislative body where František Zwyrtek served as a member, known for its work in promoting European unity and social justice."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ZWYRTEK-HANKEY FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Zwyrtek-Hankey Foundation is a philanthropic organization co-founded by Louisa Hankey and František Zwyrtek, providing support to marginalized communities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRAGUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Prague is the capital city of the Czech Republic, where Louisa Hankey and František Zwyrtek met at a high-profile charity gala."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN ARISTOCRACY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The European aristocracy is a group of high-ranking nobles and their families, including Louisa Hankey and her connections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The European aristocracy is mentioned as being excited and curious about the marriage of František and Louisa."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN POLITICAL ELITE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The European political elite includes prominent politicians and leaders, such as František Zwyrtek and Louisa Hankey's connections."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LADY VICTORIA WINDSOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lady Victoria Windsor is a close friend of Louisa Hankey and provides insight into her relationship with František Zwyrtek."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIR EDWARD HANKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sir Edward Hankey is Louisa Hankey's cousin and provides information about her after František Zwyrtek's passing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EARL OF HANKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Earl of Hankey is a title within the British peerage, held by Louisa Hankey's family."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHARITY GALA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A high-profile charity gala in Prague where Louisa Hankey and František Zwyrtek met, marking the beginning of their relationship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN SOCIETY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"European society is the broader context in which Louisa Hankey and František Zwyrtek's relationship and subsequent marriage are discussed."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN UNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"European unity is a concept promoted by František Zwyrtek through his work in the Czech Parliament."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOCIAL JUSTICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Social justice is a concept promoted by the Zwyrtek-Hankey Foundation and František Zwyrtek."&lt;SEP&gt;"Social justice is the focus of the foundation and is central to the couple's commitment and the foundation's impact."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PHILANTHROPY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Philanthropy is a concept embodied by the Zwyrtek-Hankey Foundation and Louisa Hankey's and František Zwyrtek's work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARGINALIZED COMMUNITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marginalized communities are the beneficiaries of the Zwyrtek-Hankey Foundation's work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"War is mentioned as a trial and tribulation that Louisa Hankey and Matthew Darby-Griffith faced."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC SERVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public service is a concept that both Louisa Hankey and František Zwyrtek are known for."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRIEF&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Grief is a concept experienced by Louisa Hankey after František Zwyrtek's passing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEGACY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Legacy is a concept that both Louisa Hankey and František Zwyrtek are known for, and Louisa continues to honor through her work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. HELENA NOVÁKOVÁ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Helena Nováková is the executive director of a foundation and has praised František and Louisa for their commitment to social justice."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRANTIŠEK AND LOUISA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"František and Louisa are a couple known for their commitment to social justice and have a foundation that has made a tangible difference."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The foundation is led by Dr. Helena Nováková and has been instrumental in making a tangible difference in people's lives through social justice initiatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLITICAL ELITE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The political elite is also mentioned as being excited and curious about the marriage of František and Louisa."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARRIAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The marriage of František and Louisa is the central event that has sparked excitement and curiosity among the European aristocracy and political elite."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0088</data>
    </node>
